    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frondōsus</span></b>  (anciently also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frund-</span></b> ), a, um,
